CONVERGENCE: y_of_gN via brentq is exact to xtol=1e-14; verify residual
======================================================================
  max |mu(y)y - gN/a0| over gN in [1e-3,1e3] = 1.15e-14  (background inversion converged)

CONCLUSION: a(r) sweeps continuously from deep-MOND (y0<1, large r) through the
transition and into Newtonian (y0>>1, small r); the f''<0 unstable shell 1<y0<~38
is a FINITE radial band present around EVERY realistic source. Instability is occupied.
